    "notes": "實抓列表 https://paperfishblog.netlify.app/ 使用 a[href*=\"/posts/\"]；實抓文章 https://paperfishblog.netlify.app/posts/tech/my-thesis/ 標題 h1，正文 #quarto-document-content。"
  }
